Package: hyperboria
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python (>= 2.7)
Suggests: hyperboria-dynamic
Description: Encrypted networking for regular people
 Hyperboria implements an encrypted IPv6 network using public key cryptography
 for address allocation and a distributed hash table for routing.
 This provides near zero-configuration networking without many of the security
 and robustness issues that regular IPv4 and IPv6 networks have.

Package: hyperboria-dynamic
Architecture: any
Priority: extra
Depends: hyperboria (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}, python (>= 2.7)
Description: hyperboria dynamic DNS peer resolver service
 This package contains a dynamic DNS peer resolver script that allows you to use
 hostnames instead of IP addresses for your hyperboria mesh network peers. This
 package is configured through /etc/hyperboria-dynamic.conf
